            "review_title": "Review at Anh Ngoai Quan",
            "review_text": "Tommy N\n5 contributions\n0\nWonderful Atmosphere, Fine Dining Experience\nApr 2022 • Family\nRecommended by my friend who are living in Saigon and I had reserved a table for my 45th birthday anniversary, 10 people had joined the birthday to spice up my day and it was a blast. A variety of dishes from North, Centre to South for everyone to select. They were all very authentic and delicious. I loved very much beef steak and Bia Hoi there. Prices are quite reasonable. Highly recommended for everyone!!! I will come back soon.\nRead more\nWritten May 13, 2022",
